    ("R3b-BC: does the BOST-CONNES DISCRETE MULTIPLIER (N^x, sigma_t(mu_n)=n^{it}, phase transition beta=1) supply the arithmetic radius q (N4), or only a PHASE + an EDGE?", True, False, False, "bost_connes_multiplier.py: R3b [RESIDUE block -- Bost-Connes discrete-multiplier branch; the deepest of the three discretizations R3b named (a Q_{>0}-graded line / the K6 non-metric degree / a Bost-Connes discrete multiplier), tested AFTER periodic_orbit_gap.py covered the orbit-LENGTH discretization]. The Bost-Connes system (Bost-Connes 1995; Connes-Marcolli; Consani-Marcolli for F_q) is the ONE arithmetic object carrying a genuine DISCRETE MULTIPLICATIVE semigroup N^x (Hecke isometries mu_n, mu_m mu_n = mu_{mn}) AND a phase transition / spontaneous symmetry breaking -- the strongest candidate for R3's 'a DISCRETE/GAPPED refinement carrying a finite base size at infinity'. DECISIVE SPLIT (exact mpmath 40dps): [A] BC SUPPLIES the discrete multiplicative semigroup N^x R3 named-missing -- multiplicative (mu_m mu_n=mu_{mn}, verified), discrete index gap=1 (a genuine GAP vs the R_{>0}^x continuum gap 0); so the CONTINUITY-to-DISCRETENESS half of the residue IS supplied, and it is the STRONGEST form (multiplicative, not the additive orbit-length {log p}). [B] BUT the time evolution sigma_t(mu_n)=n^{it} is a PHASE: eigenvalue MODULUS 1 (verified |n^{it}|==1 across N^x x times, max dev ~1e-26) -- the discrete semigroup refines the INDEX n but the DYNAMICAL eigenvalue is a unitary character, RADIUS-SILENT (the M3b/R2/R3 split RECURS on the discrete index). [C] the PHASE TRANSITION is at beta=1 = the EDGE (the zeta POLE = abscissa of abs. convergence = Re s=1 = the determinant |alpha beta|=p^{k-1}), NOT the radius Re s=1/2: Z(beta)=zeta(beta) -> +inf as beta->1+ (the transition), finite at beta=2, and at beta=1/2 is analytic CONTINUATION only (NO KMS state below the edge) -- the partition/KMS structure marks the EDGE, never the radius. [D] THE F_q vs Q SPLIT + the q->1 DEFORMATION: over F_q(C) the Consani-Marcolli BC carries the constant field q as an EXTERNAL FIXED base (ONE q for all places, INPUT, forces |alpha|=q^{w/2}=2,3,5 from the GROUND FIELD not the dynamics -- the dynamics gives the phase q^{it}, the ground field gives the modulus); the arithmetic (Q) BC is the q->1 limit (F_1/Spec Z), where the radius q^{w/2}->1 EVAPORATES (verified along q=5,3,2,1.5,1.1,1.001 -> 1, the circle collapses to a point) while the discrete index N^x SURVIVES base-independently, and over Z the per-place radices are DISTINCT primes with NO common ground-field q (the archimedean base is 1 = F_1). So q->1 deletes EXACTLY the radius-forcing base size, keeping the discrete index + the edge. [E] the SSB is GALOIS (zeros-blind): BC's symmetry breaking at beta=1 is by hat{Z}^x=Gal(Q^ab/Q) acting on Q/Z (roots of unity) + the KMS states, NOT on the critical strip -- class field theory, blind to zero locations; and the BC partition function IS the Euler product (Z(beta)=prod_p(1-p^-beta)^-1, verified vs zeta(2)), so DH (no product) has NO BC/Gibbs/KMS representation => the BC system FAILS TO EXIST for DH (like qsm_free_energy.py). VERDICT: the strongest discrete-multiplier candidate SPLITS like the scaling site (R3) and the periodic orbits -- the discrete semigroup N^x + the partition pole are EULER-BORNE but live at the EDGE beta=1 (abscissa/determinant), the eigenvalue n^{it} is a PHASE (radius-silent), and the radius-forcing q is an EXTERNAL ground field the q->1 limit DELETES. The DECISIVE NEW SEPARATION: 'discreteness' is SUPPLIABLE (N^x supplies it) WITHOUT supplying the 'finite base size' (the external ground field) -- so the residue is NOT 'continuity' per se but specifically the FINITE BASE SIZE that over F_q is the constant field and the arithmetic (q->1) place structurally lacks (the F_1-analogue of 'Spec Z has no constant field at infinity'). FALSIFIER: euler-borne PARTIAL (the BC partition function REQUIRES the Euler product => DH fails to define a BC system, the EDGE/partition half is Euler-borne & DH-distinguishing, the SAME Euler-borne edge the periodic orbits carried), sees-zeros NO (dynamics is a phase n^{it} modulus 1; the Galois SSB is class field theory, zeros-blind), independent N (the radius=even split=purity=RH; the q=external ground field=the solved case over F_q). => the BC discrete multiplier is the PHASE + EDGE half (discrete, multiplicative, Euler-borne at the abscissa, radius-silent); the arithmetic RADIUS q is NOT here. CONFIRMS the R3/R4 continuity obstruction from a THIRD independent direction (after the continuous scaling and the orbit length), and SHARPENS it: discreteness != finite-base-size. 39th wall confirmation"),
